  "description": "A list-like collection that stores unmanaged numeric values in the Windows Registry.\n\n\t\t\tThe collection keeps an in-memory cache of values and serializes them as a binary\n\t\t\tvalue under the specified registry key. It also watches the registry key for\n\t\t\texternal changes and refreshes the cache when the registry value is modified.",
